program	vis80_vector_length_invariant.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	field `length` of struct `Vector` is private and not accessible from this module
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: field `length` of struct `Vector` is private and not accessible from this module"
log	"  --> examples/vis80_vector_length_invariant.saw:9:6"
log	"    |"
log	" 9 |     v.length = 1000        // corrupting the invariant — now rejected"
log	"    |      ^"
log	"   hint: mark it `public` in the declaration of `Vector` to expose it"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
